            "3": "This skill gains an additional base effect: When defeated by your or your Minions' Attacks or Spells, enemies have a 30 % chance to explode, dealing True Damage equal to 6 of their Max Life to enemies within a 250 % m radius. + 10 % additional damage for you and your Minions (not affected by the effects of Elixir Skills)",
