            "5": "Obtain a Special Scent Bottle, which can be used to concoct Elixir Skills. The third Active Skill slot is treated as the Special Scent Bottle\nElixir Skills from Special Scent Bottle can be equipped with 1 Ingredient to gain its corresponding additional Base Effects"
